WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.740
Acceptance criteria are conditions that can be observed.

00:00:03.181 --> 00:00:06.885
Assign stable identifiers such as A-01, and connect each

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:08.115
to one or more checks.

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:12.028
A-01 might say a valid fictional inquiry appears once in

00:00:12.063 --> 00:00:12.817
the owner list.

00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:16.011
A test could submit a valid synthetic record and retrieve

00:00:16.034 --> 00:00:16.234
it.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:19.482
Record the scope of the evidence: a local test

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.768
demonstrates local behavior; it does not prove that a live

00:00:22.802 --> 00:00:23.963
provider is configured.

00:00:24.347 --> 00:00:27.319
Include negative paths, such as missing fields,

00:00:27.597 --> 00:00:30.059
unauthorized access, and a storage failure.
